        m_Value: Media
    - rid: 552786204080472125
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159424
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Not used by this panel type.
    - rid: 552786204080472126
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159425
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The light it switches.
    - rid: 552786204080472127
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159426
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The polygon whose platform it switches.
    - rid: 552786204080472128
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159427
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: negative, so Aleph One stops treating it as a switch as the level starts (Marathon 2 and Infinity expect a polygon here).'
    - rid: 552786204080472129
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159428
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The tag of the lights and platforms it switches.
    - rid: 552786204080472130
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159429
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Tag 0, so it switches nothing (it only makes its sound).
    - rid: 552786204080472131
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1329912669159430
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The terminal it shows.
    - rid: 552786204080472149
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1347040818380800
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} - {1} ({2})'
    - rid: 552786204080472150
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1347040835158016
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} - {1} ({2}, Aleph One only)'
    - rid: 552786204080472151
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1347040835158017
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0}, takes an item'
    - rid: 552786204080472152
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1347040839352320
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0}, breakable'
    - rid: 552786204080472153
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1347040839352321
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: this panel type''s textures are from {0}, which Marathon 2 and Infinity don''t load for this level.'
    - rid: 552786204080472154
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1347040839352322
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'The primary texture isn''t this panel type''s, so the game won''t show it: it sets the texture from the panel type as the level starts and whenever the panel switches.'
    - rid: 552786204080472156
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1405657890308096
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: All Surfaces
    - rid: 552786204080472157
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1405657898696704
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Brightens or darkens the side: it''s added to the light of each of its surfaces as they''re drawn (65536 is full light), and the result is kept between dark and full.'
    - rid: 552786204080472158
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1405657898696705
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its surfaces are lit just as their lights are.
    - rid: 552786204080472159
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1405657898696706
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Adds {0}% of full light to each surface's light.
    - rid: 552786204080472160
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1405657898696707
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Takes {0}% of full light from each surface's light.
    - rid: 552786204080472161
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1410168277057536
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Lines with polygons only on one side are always solid.
    - rid: 552786204080472162
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1410168289640448
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Beside a platform, which sets whether it's solid as the platform moves.
    - rid: 552786204080472163
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1410168289640449
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'An invisible wall: it blocks movement, but still looks open.'
    - rid: 552786204080472164
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103168
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its index in the level's lines
    - rid: 552786204080472165
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103169
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Nothing can pass through it. Between two polygons, a solid line is an invisible wall. A wall is always solid, and a platform beside it sets it as it moves.
    - rid: 552786204080472166
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103170
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Between two polygons, it can be seen through (what's beyond it is drawn)
    - rid: 552786204080472167
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103171
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its index in the level's sides
    - rid: 552786204080472168
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103172
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Which of its surfaces it draws, as its polygons' heights expose them
    - rid: 552786204080472169
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103173
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Makes it a switch, terminal or recharger, giving it one of the level's panel types and that type's texture
    - rid: 552786204080472170
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103174
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Gives the panel its class, textures and sounds. Choosing one gives the side its texture.
    - rid: 552786204080472171
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103175
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What the panel acts on, by its class (such as a light, platform, tag or terminal)
    - rid: 552786204080472172
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103176
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: A tag switch starts on (a light or platform switch starts as its light or platform is), and its texture shows it
    - rid: 552786204080472173
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103177
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It must be switched on to finish a repair mission
    - rid: 552786204080472174
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103178
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: A projectile that hits it switches it and breaks it
    - rid: 552786204080472175
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103179
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It only works while its primary surface's light is above 75%
    - rid: 552786204080472176
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103180
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Only a projectile hitting it switches it (the action key doesn't)
    - rid: 552786204080472177
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151329300103181
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
